# Components

## What Exists

### ApplicationComponent Base
All components inherit from `ApplicationComponent` (which inherits from `ViewComponent::Base`).

## Conventions

- One component per file in `app/components/`
- Component templates live alongside the Ruby class
- Use `test/components/previews/` for component previews
- Keep components focused on presentation logic

